---
import { site } from "../data/site";
import Icon from "./Icon.astro";
---
<section class="sec contact" id="kontak">
  <div class="wrap contact__inner">
    <div class="contact__copy" data-reveal>
      <h2>Mulai dari satu diskusi awal.</h2>
      <p>Ceritakan kondisi proposal dan rencana perusahaan. Kami akan memberi gambaran paket yang paling sesuai, tanpa janji pendanaan.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="contact__actions" data-reveal style="--d:140ms">
      <a class="btn btn--solid contact__btn" href={`https://wa.me/${site.whatsapp}`} target="_blank" rel="noopener">
        <Icon name="phone" size={20} />
        Chat WhatsApp
        <Icon name="arrow" size={18} />
      </a>
      <a class="btn btn--ghost contact__btn" href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>
        <Icon name="mail" size={20} />
        {site.email}
      </a>
      <p class="contact__note">Respons pada hari kerja, biasanya dalam satu hari.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .contact {
    background: var(--navy);
    color: var(--white);
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .contact::before {
    content: "";
    position: absolute;
    right: -10%;
    top: 50%;
    width: min(720px, 90vw);
    aspect-ratio: 1;
    transform: translateY(-50%);
    border-radius: 50%;
    border: 1px solid rgba(95, 168, 211, 0.22);
    box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 60px rgba(95, 168, 211, 0.03), 0 0 0 80px rgba(95, 168, 211, 0.03);
    pointer-events: none;
  }

  .contact__inner {
    position: relative;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1.2fr 1fr;
    gap: clamp(40px, 6vw, 80px);
    align-items: center;
  }

  .contact h2 {
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 4.4vw, 3.4rem);
    color: var(--white);
    margin-bottom: 20px;
  }

  .contact__copy p {
    color: #bcd3e6;
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    max-width: 48ch;
  }

  .contact__actions {
    display: grid;
    gap: 14px;
  }

  .contact__btn {
    justify-content: space-between;
    padding: 20px 24px;
    font-size: 1rem;
    width: 100%;
  }

  .contact__btn:first-child {
    background: var(--ice);
    color: var(--ink);
  }

  .contact__btn:first-child:hover {
    background: var(--white);
  }

  .contact .btn--ghost {
    color: var(--white);
    border-color: rgba(201, 228, 245, 0.35);
  }

  .contact .btn--ghost:hover {
    border-color: var(--sky);
  }

  .contact__note {
    font-size: 0.88rem;
    color: #8fb0cc;
    padding-left: 4px;
  }

  @media (max-width: 860px) {
    .contact__inner {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
</style>
